              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I added a squeeze of lime juice to the cocktail and I shook the ingredients (including the ice) in my cocktail shaker to get it really cold. One of the best adult drinks I've had in a long time."
          },
