              "name": "AndyDad"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've had a bay breeze on many occasions with this basic recipe. I do love them but changed it up today by using white peach/cranberry juice in place of cranberry. I also, as others, put the ingredients and ice in my shaker, then strained over ice in a highball glass and garnished with two maraschino cheries and a pineapple wedge.",
